[02:44.585]And I won't ever stop
{"而我永远不会停下"}
[02:46.669](That childlike silhouette)
{"（那孩子般的剪影）"}
[02:51.340]Cry so hard the words
{"声嘶力竭的呼喊"}
[02:54.224]were torn apart
{"字句支离破碎"}
[02:55.249]inside my chest
{"在我胸腔深处"}
